# Decision Records (ADRs)

> **For future Claude**: This directory contains architectural decision records. All notes follow the `type: adr` or `type: decision` schema.

## Note Types
- `type: adr` - Architectural Decision Record
- `type: decision` - General decision record
- `type: conflict` - Contradiction resolution records

## Frontmatter Schema (ADR)
```yaml
---
date: YYYY-MM-DD
type: adr
tags: [adr, decision]
decision: ""                  # one-line summary
status: proposed | accepted | superseded
related-projects: ["[[Projects/...]]", ...]
supersedes: "[[Knowledge/ADR-...]]"   # optional; equivalent to relations.supersedes
relations:                  # optional, for richer decision graphs
  supersedes: ["[[...]]"]
  depends_on: ["[[...]]"]
  caused_by: ["[[...]]"]
  decided_by: ["[[...]]"]
  relates_to: ["[[...]]"]
  contradicts: ["[[...]]"]
ai-first: true
---
```

## Note Structure
Each ADR should contain:
- `## For future Claude` preamble
- `## Decision` - The decision made
- `## Context` - What prompted this decision
- `## Options Considered` - Alternatives evaluated
- `## Rationale` - Why this option was chosen
- `## Consequences` - What changed as a result
- `## Related Decisions` - Links to other ADRs

## Naming Convention
- `ADR-YYYY-MM-DD - Title.md`
- Example: `ADR-2026-08-04 - D-Bus Interface Design.md`
